<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Rural Press half yr net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Rural Press half yr net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    28.09 vs 27.16</p>
<p>    Net				     16.96 vs 16.27</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     4.00 vs 4.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Rural Press Ltd is an agricultural and regional newspaper and radio station operator.  </p>
<p>    Sales				    155.96 vs 135.17</p>
<p>    Other income			     1.79 vs 1.24</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     10.70 vs 10.20</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			    nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Mar 4</p>
<p>Reg date Feb 28</p>
<p>    Tax					 10.23 vs 9.92</p>
<p>    Interest				   3.96 vs 2.80</p>
<p>    Depreciation			     4.85 vs 4.04</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
